== 1. Plan again with this build: a HealthCheck and a ClusterHealthCheck for the kyverno profile (07:32:13)
$ cub sveltos apply onboard-watch/profiles.yaml clusters-now.yaml --class-label class --stage-label class --stages test,uat,prod --prefix mer --out onboard-ch
Onboarding plan: 1 component made from 3 profiles over 6 clusters, one variant per cluster per component (6 variants).
Nothing has changed. This is what ConfigHub would hold.

