== 2. A workload goes down after its release was applied: test1's node is cordoned and the cleanup controller's pod deleted (07:36:39)
$ kubectl --kubeconfig test1.kubeconfig cordon node/mer-test1-control-plane
node/mer-test1-control-plane cordoned
$ kubectl --kubeconfig test1.kubeconfig -n kyverno delete pod -l app.kubernetes.io/component=cleanup-controller --wait=false
pod "kyverno-cleanup-controller-59c8fdfb66-97nnv" deleted from kyverno namespace
-- 07:40:43, 238s later, the ClusterHealthCheck on eu-central-test1: False Deployment: kyverno/kyverno-background-controller status is Degraded Message: kyverno-background-controller: 0 of 1 available Deployment: kyverno/kyverno-cleanup-controller status is Progressing Message: kyverno-cleanup-controller: rolling out 
